FYI - resolved this by making sure the input selections to the selectInput dropdown had unique values! Very simple fix but the error message and behavior was confusing. There were repeated draft years of course for multiple players, so you cannot populate a dropdown with multiple repeated values if you'd like to set the default to a specific value on load.

On Monday, November 30, 2015 at 11:29:24 PM UTC-5, tcash21 wrote:

> Hello,
>
> I've deployed my app here so you can see the behavior: https://tcb-analytics.shinyapps.io/test
>
> You can see on load the draft year is set to 2011, but then it changes to "" which causes an error in subsetting the data. I thought by simply setting selected = '2011' it would automatically display the data for that year on load.
>
> Here's the code for server.R and ui.R.
